	"drupal/views_data_export": "enabled against a real site; the `data_export` views display and style plugins are registered, which is the whole module",
	"drupal/webform": "enabled against a real site; four of its plugin managers resolve, the `webform` table exists and its shipped option sets are installed. Submissions are ordinary form POSTs",
	"drupal/xmlsitemap": "enabled against a real site; `xmlsitemap_generator` and `xmlsitemap.link_storage` resolve, the `xmlsitemap` table exists and its settings are installed"
